WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.601
-So, now, it's
the end of the week.

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.067
That's usually when I catch up
on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:06.000
-Mm-hmm, things like checking
your inbox,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.434
returning some e-mails,
and thank-you notes.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.567
-Yes. Yes, I'll write some
thank-you notes. I was behind.

00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:12.968
Running behind today.
I was just wondering if I could

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:14.133
write out some thank-you notes
right now.

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:15.734
You guys mind?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:18.601
-Okay.
Is it cool if I write some too?

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:20.300
-Of course. You have to.
-Okay. Yes, I'm here.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.934
-Here we go. Can we get some
thank-you-note

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:24.367
writing music, please?
♪♪

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:25.767
Beautiful.
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:25.767 --> 00:00:27.634
-It's beautiful. Here we go.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.367
Thank you, dimmer switches,

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.834
for letting me feel like I'm
deejaying my living room.

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:37.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes!

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:42.334
Okay. Me, me, me.
-Go, go, go.

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:43.634
-Okay.

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:46.234
Thank you, birthday candles,

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:48.601
for being crayons
that like to get lit.

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:50.501
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.634
-This is fun.
-Yes.

00:00:55.634 --> 00:00:57.234
-Here we go. Alright.

00:00:59.467 --> 00:01:02.367
Thank you, clothes steamers,

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:04.634
or as I like to call you,
shirt Botox.

00:01:04.634 --> 00:01:06.300
There you go.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.400
-Okay, okay.
-Alright.

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:14.868
-Thank you, the phrase,
"let me check my calendar,"

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:17.400
for being the prequel
to the word "no."

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:18.934 --> 00:01:21.801
-Ah. "Yeah, let me check
my calendar."

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:23.701
-Yes. "No."
-Yeah, no, I can't do it.

00:01:23.701 --> 00:01:25.267
Alright, here we go.
-Boom.

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:32.000
-Thank you, steel wool,

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.200
for looking like a loofah
for robots.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:38.234
-Okay. Okay.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.033
Thank you, postcards,

00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:45.834
for making the government
deliver my Instagram.

00:01:45.834 --> 00:01:47.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:51.067
-I guess that is true.
That's what they are.

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:52.801
I like this one.

00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:59.534
Thank you, Kim Kardashian's
new skin-toned headphones,

00:01:59.534 --> 00:02:01.901
because when I have earbuds in,

00:02:01.901 --> 00:02:04.534
I want people to not see them
and try to talk to me.

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:11.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:13.334
"Oh, I didn't realize
you were wearing --"

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:17.667
"What? I got -- I got a pod --"
-I'll never, like, okay.

00:02:17.667 --> 00:02:18.868
So, I saw Kim.

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:22.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:26.234
I saw Kim Kardashian post
these ear pods.

00:02:26.234 --> 00:02:28.133
I thought they were
organic eggs.

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:30.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:31.834
-You thought she's selling eggs?

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:33.834
-I didn't know what was
happening. I didn't know.

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:38.133
She had a deal with Whole Foods.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.133 --> 00:02:41.234
-Okay. You're up.
Sorry, you're up.

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:42.634
-Okay, is it me?
-Yeah.

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:51.300
-Okay, thank you, drinks labeled
elixir, for being shorthand for

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.234
"you're about to drop $8
on apple juice."

00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:55.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:55.534 --> 00:02:59.234
-They sneak that in there.
Oh, it's an elixir. Yeah.

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:00.934
Alright. Here we go.

00:03:03.934 --> 00:03:07.634
Thank you, Swiss Army knives,
for being one knife,

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:10.367
one bottle opener, and 37 other
things I'll never use.

00:03:10.367 --> 00:03:12.567
There you go.
What am I gonna do with this?

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:14.634
[ Applause ]
-Okay.

00:03:14.634 --> 00:03:16.100
-Alright, bud. Here we go.
-Okay.

00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:23.968
Thank you, Earth, for taking hot
girl summer way too literally.

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:25.434
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Yeah, oh, my God.

00:03:25.434 --> 00:03:27.834
It's too hot. It is too hot!

00:03:27.834 --> 00:03:29.300
That's my thank-you notes.

